    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ウソでしょ！？
何よ、それ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's no way, right!?
He can't actually mean it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くそーっ！
食ってやる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dammit...! Then, I'll
just stuff myself!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>リバウンドで
１０キロ太っちゃった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've gained another 22
pounds of rebound weight...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見えないでしょ……？
着やせするタイプなの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can't tell, right...? I always
look much slimmer in clothes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぽっちゃりした子が
好きだよって言った彼は
戻ってこなかったけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My boyfriend said he
likes pudgy girls, but he
still hasn't come back, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいの、寛容な心で許すわ
だって今の私は
おおらかな女ですもの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's fine. I have the tolerance to let
it go. After all, I'm a woman with a very,
very big, huge, humongous...um, heart.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
